704173322 (category 'Consulting') showed the Category dropdown reset to placeholder 'Select category' instead of the current value. Saving the edit (description/amount/tax changed, category untouched) resulted in the transaction's category becoming blank in the table/collection ('' instead of 'Consulting'). Delete function worked correctly and updated totals.\", \"evidence\": \"transactions.table item after update: [\\\\\\\"tx-1787704173322\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"QA Test Consulting Income UPDATED\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Aug 26, 2026\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"+$700.00\\\\\\\"]\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created 'QA Test Category' (income, violet); edited name to 'QA Test Category Updated' and color to rose, both persisted correctly on reopen; deleted the unused category and it was removed from the Income Categories list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Transaction form category options change based on Type: Income type showed only Sales Revenue/Consulting/Interest Income/Other Income; Expense type showed only Office Supplies/Rent/Utilities/Salaries/Marketing/Travel/Software/Insurance. Newly created transaction retained its assigned category (Consulting) immediately after creation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tax Related toggle set true on create (tax column showed ✓) and successfully unmarked to false on edit (tax column cleared after update).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combining search='Strategy' + type=Income + category=Consulting + date range Dec1-31 2024 narrowed results to exactly tx-6 which satisfies all 4 criteria. Clicking 'Clear Filters' restored all 18 transactions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Description and Amount inputs are HTML-required; submitting empty form kept dialog open and native validation message 'Please fill out this field.' present on both fields, blocking creation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Invalid date range (start after end) not rejected or explained\", \"actual\": \"Set From=2024-12-31 and To=2024-12-01 in transaction filters. No validation error appeared; the app silently accepted the invalid range and displayed a generic 'No transactions found / Try adjusting your filters' message instead of identifying that the start date is later than the end date.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Transaction created without a category assigned\", \"actual\": \"Filled Description and Amount but left Category unselected, then clicked Add Expense. Transaction 'CS23 Test No Category' was created successfully with a blank category field and no error message shown to the user.\", \"evidence\": \"transactions.table item: [\\\\\\\"tx-1787704253829\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"CS23 Test No Category\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Aug 26, 2026\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"-$50.00\\\\\\\"]\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-24\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Deleting a category in use leaves transactions with a blank category instead of being blocked or requiring reassignment\", \"actual\": \"Deleted 'Utilities' category (had 1 transaction, 'Electric Bill'). Confirmation dialog only warned 'Transactions using this category will not be deleted' with no reassignment option and allowed deletion. After deletion, transaction tx-4 'Electric Bill' now shows an empty/blank category field instead of 'Utilities' or a placeholder like 'Unknown'.\", \"evidence\": \"transactions.table.item.tx-4.category value = ''\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Added expense $200 dated Aug 26 2026 (current month). Dashboard immediately showed Monthly Expenses $200, Net Profit -$200, and the new transaction at top of Recent Transactions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Unmarked 'Electric Bill' (-$285, Utilities) as tax-related via edit form (toggle turned false). Tax Summary 2024 transaction count dropped from 18 to 17, Total Deductible Expenses dropped from $36,485.99 to $36,200.99, and the transaction no longer appears in 'All Tax-Related Transactions'.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After adding $200 Office Supplies expense, category card updated from '2 transactions / $1,046' to '3 transactions / $1,246'.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked 'Print Report' on Tax Summary (year 2024 selected). Page remained functional, no console errors, no application error thrown (0 errors reported after action).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Transactions table columns: Date, Description, Category, Reference, Amount, Tax, Actions; footer shows Total Income +$47,592.50 and Total Expenses -$36,485.99 for current result set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Added income transaction +$300.25 (Aug 26 2026, current month). Dashboard Monthly Income showed $300 (rounded), Net Profit $300, and transaction appeared first in Recent Activity. Reports page for August 2026 showed exact figures: Income $300.25, Expenses $0, Profit +$300.25, and 'Sales Revenue' category breakdown $300.25 - all consistent with the underlying transaction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Chart y-axis labels round to thousands and cannot represent non-zero sub-$500 values\", \"actual\": \"Added an income transaction of $300.25 in August 2026, making the 'Income vs Expenses' dashboard chart's August bar non-zero. All 5 y-axis tick labels on that chart still read '$0k' (values formatted in whole thousands with 0 decimals), making the non-zero $300.25 value indistinguishable from zero on the axis.\", \"evidence\": \"SVG text nodes for chart y-axis: [\\\\\\\"$0k\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"$0k\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"$0k\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"$0k\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"$0k\\\\\\\"] while August contains a +$300.25 transaction.\"}]}"
